# Annie Flash, the Veteran put onto the battlefield by Sneak Attack was not cast, so her enters ability doesn't trigger and
# the Black Lotus (mana value 0) stays in the graveyard. Hasted, she attacks and the two exiled cards are left unplayed (the
# "may": declined); on Bot1's next turn neither the Mountain nor the Lightning Bolt can be played from exile any more
# (CR 514.2: "this turn" ended), though untapped Moxen could pay for the Bolt.

